## Problems Solved

| No. | Problem | Topic | Time Complexity | Space Complexity |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Diagonal Difference | 2D Arrays | O(N) | O(1) |
| 2 | Dynamic Array | Dynamic Arrays, XOR | O(N + Q) | O(N) |
| 3 | Time Conversion | Strings and Logic | O(1) | O(1) |
| 4 | Compare the Triplets | Basic Implementation | O(1) | O(1) |
| 5 | Sparse Arrays | Frequency Counting | O(N + Q) | O(N) |

*Note: Complexity depends on the input sizes and implementation. For Sparse Arrays, N represents the total length of the input strings and Q represents the number of queries.*

